{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はある番組用の\n振り入れがありました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて出演する番組で\nいつもテレビでみてたから\nたのしみ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張すると思うけど、\n楽しんでできるようにたくさん練習します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/0392613/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/0392613/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってた\nハーフアップのお団子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/0392613/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、れなと遊んだーって\n言ったんだけど\n実は夜ご飯も一緒に食べて\nれながつくってくれたんだー٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくお料理が上手で\n憧れました(｡・・｡)♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！れなにお料理習おう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、\n高校の時の家庭科の調理実習でも\nれなは率先していろいろつくってくれてました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、私は\nひたすら洗ってたよ！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗い物係！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生の時に男女混合チームでやってた\n家庭科の調理実習の時は\n男の子が洗い物係だったから\n作る方にまわってたけど\n本当は洗う方が得意なの！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！もう20歳になるし\nお料理もがんばろー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/0392613/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でーーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/0392613/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなの手作りスパケッチィ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フレッシュトマトのチーズパスタ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/0392613/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週からはお互い忙しくなっちゃうから\nしばらく遊べなくなるかなー？。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや！でも美容院いきたいんだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいきたいから、あえる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、映画もいくんだった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/0392613/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、クルージングですね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られる方は一緒に楽しみましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年もクルージングあったんだけど\n夜ご飯がたのしみ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイキング♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、どこの席に座るのかも\nドキドキするよね！！！くじ引きだし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこの席になって\n誰とおなじチームになるかわからないけど\n今年は勝ちたいな！！！ゲーム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが教えてくださった音楽\n一曲ずつ順番にきいていこーっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バンド系が多いですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はバンド系の音楽すきです！"}],"source":"archive"}